{"id":"9d14825f449580ab","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-friedberg-jump-inversion.md","title":"Friedberg 跳跃反演","display":"thm-friedberg-jump-inversion — Friedberg 跳跃反演","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-friedberg-jump-inversion","aliases":["20-thm-friedberg-jump-inversion"],"display":"thm-friedberg-jump-inversion — Friedberg 跳跃反演","chapter":"6","section":"6.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"source-verified","source_reference":"Theorem 6.4.1","source_pdf_pages":[173,174],"source_printed_pages":[139,140],"depends_on":["[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-join]]","[[20-df-degle]]","[[20-df-1gen]]","[[20-thm-deg-join]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-friedberg-jump-inversion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-friedberg-jump-inversion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-friedberg-jump-inversion — Friedberg 跳跃反演"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-verified"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 6.4.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>173</span><span>174</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>139</span><span>140</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cc0aeae8dce11855\" href=\"?note=cc0aeae8dce11855\" title=\"20-thm-deg-join\">20-thm-deg-join</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf d\\ge\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf d\\ge\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"cc0aeae8dce11855\" href=\"?note=cc0aeae8dce11855\" title=\"20-thm-deg-join\">20-thm-deg-join</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}friedberg\\text{-}jump\\text{-}inversion}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\\n[\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf d\\land\\mathbf a&#39;=\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf0&#39;=\\mathbf d].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}friedberg\\text{-}jump\\text{-}inversion}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\\n[\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf d\\land\\mathbf a&#39;=\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf0&#39;=\\mathbf d].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在有限延伸中交替决定第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个对角停止计算并编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf d\">\\(\\mathbf d\\)</span> 的代表元的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 位。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\ge_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(D\\ge_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 能完成延伸存在性搜索；解码需 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。此结论不要求反演出的度为 c.e.，也不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 6.4.1；印刷页 139, 140；PDF 第 173, 174 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-degle]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-1gen","status":"resolved","id":"b03a71cd282632fa","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-1gen]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-deg-join","status":"resolved","id":"cc0aeae8dce11855","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-deg-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":""